#: ../../gas_laws/reproduction.rst:3
msgid "計算条件と再現手順"
msgstr "Calculation Conditions and Reproduction Procedure"

#: ../../gas_laws/reproduction.rst:5
msgid ""
"この例題の数値は、WSL上のDockerでGROMACS 2026.2を実行して得たものです。\\ "
"Quloudの画面から投入したジョブではありません。\\ Quloud用のCIF入力・トポロジー生成・ローカル実行ランナーを用いました。\\ "
"記事のArのP–V計算と5気体比較は、標準イメージの混合精度で実行しています。\\ 同じGROMACS "
"2026.2の倍精度ビルドによる計算も、数値条件への依存性を調べる参考値として保存しています。\\ "
"モデルYAMLとトポロジー生成処理は共通です。\\ Quloudの実画面での再実行と、本番環境との出力の照合は未確認です。"
msgstr ""
"We obtained the values in this example by running GROMACS 2026.2 in "
"Docker on WSL. \\ We did not submit these Jobs through the Quloud "
"interface. \\ We used Quloud’s CIF inputs, topology generation, and local"
" runner. \\ We ran the Ar P–V calculations and the five-gas comparison in"
" mixed precision with the standard image. \\ We also kept results from a "
"double-precision build of the same GROMACS 2026.2 release as reference "
"values for examining sensitivity to numerical settings. \\ Both used the "
"same model YAML files and topology generation process. \\ Rerunning the "
"calculations through the Quloud interface and checking the output against"
" the production environment remain unverified."

#: ../../gas_laws/reproduction.rst:15
msgid ""
"第2回は分子の重心の速さと、5気体がいずれも約1 atmになる大まかな比較に範囲を絞っています。\\ "
"気体ごとの1%未満の圧力差は数値条件によって動くため、物性の差とは解釈しません。\\ "
"Quloudの実画面でのジョブ投入・編集・出力回収は未確認です。以下の操作手順は参考として示します。"
msgstr ""
"Part 2 is limited to molecular center-of-mass speeds and a rough "
"comparison showing that the pressures of all five gases are near 1 atm. "
"\\ Pressure differences of less than 1% between gases vary with the "
"numerical settings, so we do not interpret them as differences in "
"physical properties. \\ We have yet to verify Job submission, editing, "
"and output retrieval in the Quloud interface. The steps below are "
"provided for reference."

#: ../../gas_laws/reproduction.rst:20
msgid "入力とモデル"
msgstr "Inputs and Models"

#: ../../gas_laws/reproduction.rst:22
msgid ""
"計算セルは3方向周期境界の立方体です。Arは1,000原子、H₂・N₂・O₂は各2,000原子、\\ "
"CO₂は3,000原子で、いずれも1,000分子に相当します。\\ "
"ランダムな分子の中心と向きを固定シード1101、2202、3303で生成しました。\\ 異なる分子の中心間を0.8 "
"nm以上離し、周期境界を含む原子間距離も別に調べています。\\ "
"分子の識別後の原子順・分子数・質量・電荷・拘束は、実際のTPRと生成済みITPで確認しました。"
msgstr ""
"The simulation cell is a cube with periodic boundary conditions in all "
"three directions. It contains 1,000 atoms for Ar, 2,000 each for H₂, N₂, "
"and O₂, \\ and 3,000 for CO₂, corresponding to 1,000 molecules in each "
"case. \\ We generated random molecular centers and orientations using the"
" fixed seeds 1101, 2202, and 3303. \\ We kept the centers of distinct "
"molecules at least 0.8 nm apart and separately checked interatomic "
"distances, including across periodic boundaries. \\ After identifying the"
" molecules, we checked the atom order, molecule count, masses, charges, "
"and constraints against the actual TPR and the generated ITP."

