#: ../../gas_laws/reproduction.rst:59
msgid ""
"Arには ``argon_vrabec`` [1]_ 、H₂・N₂・O₂には ``hydrogen_iff12_6`` 、\\ "
"``nitrogen_iff12_6`` 、 ``oxygen_iff12_6`` [2]_ 、CO₂には ``co2_trappe`` [3]_"
" を使います。\\ 異なる原子種のLJパラメータの混合則はLorentz–Berthelotです。"
msgstr ""
"We use ``argon_vrabec`` [1]_ for Ar, ``hydrogen_iff12_6``, \\ "
"``nitrogen_iff12_6``, and ``oxygen_iff12_6`` [2]_ for H₂, N₂, and O₂, and"
" ``co2_trappe`` [3]_ for CO₂. \\ We use the Lorentz–Berthelot mixing rule"
" for LJ parameters of different atom types."

#: ../../gas_laws/reproduction.rst:65
msgid ""
"登録CO₂モデルは、文献の完全な剛体TraPPEモデルをそのまま実装したものではありません。\\ "
"数値積分上の理由から角度に調和ポテンシャルを使っており、500 kJ/mol/rad²は文献値ではありません。\\ "
"N₂・O₂の結合も登録時に剛体化されています。\\ ここで比較するのは、これらの登録モデルを用いた古典MDです。\\ "
"とくにH₂の回転・振動の量子効果まで再現する計算ではありません。"
msgstr ""
"The registered CO₂ model differs from the fully rigid TraPPE model in the"
" literature. \\ It uses a harmonic potential for the angle for numerical "
"integration, and the value of 500 kJ/mol/rad² does not come from the "
"literature. \\ The bonds in N₂ and O₂ were also made rigid when the "
"models were registered. \\ We compare classical MD simulations using "
"these registered models. \\ In particular, the simulations do not "
"reproduce the quantum effects of rotation and vibration in H₂."

#: ../../gas_laws/reproduction.rst:72
msgid "Quloudでの設定（実画面では未確認）"
msgstr "Quloud Settings (Unverified in the Interface)"

#: ../../gas_laws/reproduction.rst:74
msgid ""
"以下はソースの読み取りで確認した編集経路です。実画面で操作確認した手順ではありません。\\ "
"ローカルでは、この編集後に相当する入力をQuloud用ランナーで実行しています。"
msgstr ""
"We identified the editing workflow below by reading the source code. The "
"steps have yet to be verified in the interface. \\ We ran the equivalent "
"of the edited inputs locally with the Quloud runner."

#: ../../gas_laws/reproduction.rst:77
msgid ""
"`Quloudオンラインマニュアル <https://manual.quloud-platform.quemix.com/>`__\\ "
"のMaterialのファイルアップロードでCIFを登録し、GROMACSの古典分子動力学を選びます。\\ 温度273.15 "
"K、アンサンブルNVTにします。NPTは用いません。\\ ArのP–V計算では時間刻み2 "
"fs、220,000ステップ、V-rescale、温度緩和時間0.1 psを使います。\\ "
"計算開始前のRegistered状態で、Jobのファイル一覧から生成された ``nvt.mdp`` を開いて編集します。\\ "
"画面のJob設定を変更するとMDPが再生成されるため、ファイルの追記は最後に行い、保存後に内容を確認します。\\ "
"新しいMDPをアップロードする必要はありません。"
msgstr ""
"As described in the `Quloud online manual <https://manual.quloud-"
"platform.quemix.com/>`__ \\ (in Japanese), register the CIF using \"File "
"Upload\" for the Material and select \"Classical Molecular Dynamics "
"(GROMACS)\". \\ Set \"Temperature\" to 273.15 K and \"Ensemble\" to \"NVT"
" (canonical)\". Do not use NPT. \\ For the Ar P–V calculations, set "
"\"Timestep\" to 2 fs, \"Number of Steps\" to 220,000, \"Temperature "
"Coupling Algorithm\" to \"V-rescale (recommended)\", and the relaxation "
"time (\"Temperature Coupling Time Constant\") to 0.1 ps. \\ Before "
"starting the calculation, while the Job status is \"Registered\", open "
"and edit the generated ``nvt.mdp`` in the Job’s Files tab. \\ Changing "
"the Job settings in the interface regenerates the MDP file, so make these"
" edits last and check the contents after saving. \\ There is no need to "
"upload a new MDP file."

#: ../../gas_laws/reproduction.rst:85
msgid "ArのP–V計算で追記・確認する出力設定は次のとおりです。\\ 同じキーがあれば行を置き換えてください。"
msgstr ""
"Add or check the following output settings for the Ar P–V calculations. "
"\\ Replace any existing lines with the same keys."

#: ../../gas_laws/reproduction.rst:88
msgid ""
"gen-seed = 1101\n"
"ld-seed = 101101\n"
"nstcalcenergy = 50\n"
"nstenergy = 50\n"
"nstlog = 5000\n"
"nstxout-compressed = 500\n"
"nstxout = 500\n"
"nstvout = 500\n"
"comm-mode = Linear\n"
"nstcomm = 100\n"
"rlist = 1.2\n"
"rcoulomb = 1.2\n"
"rvdw = 1.2\n"
"DispCorr = no"
msgstr ""
"gen-seed = 1101\n"
"ld-seed = 101101\n"
"nstcalcenergy = 50\n"
"nstenergy = 50\n"
"nstlog = 5000\n"
"nstxout-compressed = 500\n"
"nstxout = 500\n"
"nstvout = 500\n"
"comm-mode = Linear\n"
"nstcomm = 100\n"
"rlist = 1.2\n"
"rcoulomb = 1.2\n"
"rvdw = 1.2\n"
"DispCorr = no"

#: ../../gas_laws/reproduction.rst:105
msgid ""
"シード2202と3303では、 ``gen-seed`` と ``ld-seed`` "
"をそれぞれ2202と102202、3303と103303にします。\\ 入力の ``coulombtype = PME`` "
"は、電荷のないAr・H₂・N₂・O₂でコンテナが ``Cut-off`` に変更します。\\ "
"正味電荷が0でも各原子に電荷を持つCO₂ではPMEが維持されます。\\ 比較に使うのはアップロード時のMDPだけでなく、実行後の "
"``mdout.mdp`` とTPRの設定です。"
msgstr ""
"For seeds 2202 and 3303, set ``gen-seed`` and ``ld-seed`` to 2202 and "
"102202, or to 3303 and 103303, respectively. \\ For Ar, H₂, N₂, and O₂, "
"whose atoms carry no charge, the container changes the input setting "
"``coulombtype = PME`` to ``Cut-off``. \\ For CO₂, the atoms carry charges"
" even though the net charge is zero, so PME stays enabled. \\ The "
"comparison uses the settings in the uploaded MDP as well as those in "
"``mdout.mdp`` and the TPR after the run."

#: ../../gas_laws/reproduction.rst:110
msgid ""
"5気体の比較では、分子内運動と並進の熱の分配を整えるため、\\ "
"RegisteredのJobで次も変更します。これはGROMACSの確率的動力学によるNVTです。"
msgstr ""
"To distribute thermal energy between intramolecular motion and "
"translation in the five-gas comparison, \\ make the following additional "
"edits while the Job is \"Registered\". This runs NVT with GROMACS "
"stochastic dynamics."

#: ../../gas_laws/reproduction.rst:113
msgid ""
"integrator = sd\n"
"tcoupl = no\n"
"tc-grps = System\n"
"ref-t = 273.15\n"
"tau-t = 0.1\n"
"pcoupl = no"
msgstr ""
"integrator = sd\n"
"tcoupl = no\n"
"tc-grps = System\n"
"ref-t = 273.15\n"
"tau-t = 0.1\n"
"pcoupl = no"

#: ../../gas_laws/reproduction.rst:122
msgid ""
"``tcoupl = no`` でも、 ``sd`` 自体の摩擦と乱数が熱浴を表します。\\ "
"今回の軌跡を使って実在気体の拡散係数や衝突時間を議論することはしません。\\ H₂は0.5 fs、880,000ステップにし、出力間隔は "
"``nstcalcenergy = nstenergy = 200`` 、\\ ``nstxout = nstvout = nstxout-"
"compressed = 2000`` 、 ``nstlog = 20000`` とします。\\ ほかの4気体は2 "
"fs、220,000ステップです。\\ どちらも全体440 psのうち、40 psより後の400 psを測定区間にします。"
msgstr ""
"Even with ``tcoupl = no``, the friction and random forces in ``sd`` "
"itself represent a heat bath. \\ We do not use these trajectories to "
"discuss diffusion coefficients or collision times for real gases. \\ For "
"H₂, use a 0.5 fs time step and 880,000 steps, with output settings "
"``nstcalcenergy = nstenergy = 200``, \\ ``nstxout = nstvout = nstxout-"
"compressed = 2000``, and ``nstlog = 20000``. \\ For the other four gases,"
" use 2 fs and 220,000 steps. \\ In both cases the production period is "
"the 400 ps after the first 40 ps of the 440 ps run."

#: ../../gas_laws/reproduction.rst:131
msgid ""
"この記事の混合精度での比較を再現するときは、時間刻みをH₂は0.5 fs、ほかは2 fsにし、表の値より小さくしないでください。\\ "
"拘束力による圧力の数値誤差は、刻みを小さくするだけでは改善せず、むしろ大きくなる条件があります。\\ "
"これは今回の条件を再現するための指定で、圧力が時間刻みについて収束していることを意味しません。"
msgstr ""
"To reproduce the mixed-precision comparison in this example, use 0.5 fs "
"for H₂ and 2 fs for the other gases. Do not use a time step smaller than "
"the tabulated value. \\ Reducing the time step alone does not necessarily"
" reduce numerical pressure errors from constraint forces and can increase"
" them under some conditions. \\ These settings reproduce the conditions "
"used here. They do not imply that the pressure has converged with respect"
" to the time step."

#: ../../gas_laws/reproduction.rst:135
msgid "CO₂はCoulomb項のカットオフとPME格子間隔をともに5倍にしています [4]_ 。\\ LJ項のカットオフ1.2 nmは変えません。"
msgstr ""
"For CO₂, we increased both the Coulomb cutoff and the PME grid spacing by"
" a factor of five [4]_. \\ The LJ cutoff stays at 1.2 nm."

#: ../../gas_laws/reproduction.rst:138
msgid ""
"coulombtype = PME\n"
"rlist = 6.0\n"
"rcoulomb = 6.0\n"
"rvdw = 1.2\n"
"fourierspacing = 0.6\n"
"pme-order = 4\n"
"ewald-rtol = 1e-5\n"
"lincs-order = 4\n"
"lincs-iter = 1"
msgstr ""
"coulombtype = PME\n"
"rlist = 6.0\n"
"rcoulomb = 6.0\n"
"rvdw = 1.2\n"
"fourierspacing = 0.6\n"
"pme-order = 4\n"
"ewald-rtol = 1e-5\n"
"lincs-order = 4\n"
"lincs-iter = 1"

#: ../../gas_laws/reproduction.rst:150
msgid ""
"この調整は数値誤差が0になることを意味しません。\\ 倍精度・LINCS次数8・反復2の参考条件で、元の1.2 nm／0.12 nm設定と、\\ "
"4つの同一状態からそれぞれ10ステップ進める比較を行いました。\\ 圧力差は各短区間の平均で−0.00070〜−0.00082 "
"bar、瞬間値では最大0.00083 barでした。\\ 一方向の差があり、参考値の統計標準誤差と同程度です。\\ 400 "
"ps平均の系統誤差の上限を与える検証ではなく、長時間のPME収束確認は残っています。"
msgstr ""
"This adjustment does not eliminate numerical error. \\ In double "
"precision with LINCS order 8 and two iterations, we compared the adjusted"
" settings with the original 1.2 nm and 0.12 nm settings, \\ advancing "
"each of the four starting states by 10 steps with both settings. \\ The "
"mean pressure differences for the short intervals ranged from −0.00070 to"
" −0.00082 bar, with a maximum instantaneous difference of 0.00083 bar. \\"
" The differences had the same sign and were comparable in magnitude to "
"the statistical standard error of the reference result. \\ This test "
"gives no upper bound on the systematic error in the 400 ps average. PME "
"convergence over longer runs remains to be checked."

#: ../../gas_laws/reproduction.rst:157
msgid ""
"全5種で記事の混合精度SDには ``lincs-order = 4`` 、 ``lincs-iter = 1`` を使います。\\ "
"次に示す倍精度CO₂の参考値だけは次数8・反復2です。"
msgstr ""
"The mixed-precision SD simulations in the article use ``lincs-order = 4``"
" and ``lincs-iter = 1`` for all five gases. \\ Only the double-precision "
"CO₂ reference results shown next use order 8 and two iterations."

#: ../../gas_laws/reproduction.rst:161
msgid "温度制御と計算精度による違い"
msgstr "Effects of Temperature Control and Calculation Precision"

#: ../../gas_laws/reproduction.rst:163
msgid ""
"V-rescaleでは全体の温度が約273 Kでも、CO₂の並進が過熱しました。\\ その結果を :numref:`tab-vrescale-"
"reference` に示します。\\ 各試行の温度も含む数値は配布データの ``vrescale_reference.csv`` "
"に保存しています。\\ H₂の2 fs・シード2202はLINCS警告で停止したため、平均値を載せていません。\\ "
"成功した試行も含め、分子間の細かな物性比較には採用していません。"
msgstr ""
"With V-rescale, we observed overheating of CO₂’s translational motion "
"even though the overall temperature was about 273 K. \\ The results are "
"shown in :numref:`tab-vrescale-reference`. \\ The downloaded "
"``vrescale_reference.csv`` includes the numerical results and "
"temperatures for each run. \\ We omit averages for H₂ at 2 fs with seed "
"2202 because the run stopped with a LINCS warning. \\ We excluded all "
"these runs, including those that completed, from any comparison of small "
"differences in gas properties."

#: ../../gas_laws/reproduction.rst:169
msgid "V-rescaleの試行結果（混合精度、40〜440 ps）"
msgstr "V-rescale runs (mixed precision, 40–440 ps)"

