#: ../../gas_laws/reproduction.rst:176
msgid ""
"全体の温度制御だけでは、希薄な気体の並進と内部運動の温度が短時間でそろうとは限りません。\\ "
"標準設定の適用範囲を考える際にも、この区別が必要です。\\ SDでは熱浴が各原子に直接作用するため、熱平衡の分布を作る方法として使っています。"
msgstr ""
"Controlling the overall temperature alone does not guarantee that "
"translational and internal temperatures in a dilute gas will equilibrate "
"quickly. \\ This distinction also matters when assessing where the "
"default settings apply. \\ In SD, the heat bath acts directly on each "
"atom, so we use SD to generate a thermal equilibrium distribution."

#: ../../gas_laws/reproduction.rst:180
msgid ""
"圧力の計算精度依存性を :numref:`tab-precision-reference` に示します。\\ "
"比較の温度制御はどちらもSDで、各3シード・400 psの時間平均です。\\ "
"これらは計算設定ごとの記録であり、気体間の物性差を測定した表ではありません。\\ 原データの ``gas_summary.csv`` と "
"``precision_reference.csv`` も同じ扱いです。"
msgstr ""
":numref:`tab-precision-reference` shows how pressure depends on numerical"
" precision. \\ Both sets use SD for temperature control. The values are "
"time averages over 400 ps, combined across three seeds each. \\ The table"
" records results for different numerical settings. It does not measure "
"differences in physical properties between gases. \\ The same applies to "
"the source data in ``gas_summary.csv`` and ``precision_reference.csv``."

