"changed the results by amounts comparable to or smaller than the "
"estimated statistical error. \\ The same conclusion does not necessarily "
"hold for the mixed-precision pressures used in the article. \\ The "
"shorter controls have a production period of only 100 ps and do not "
"guarantee high-precision convergence with respect to the time step or "
"system size."

