#: ../../gas_laws/reproduction.rst:371
msgid ""
"H₂では0.5 fsから0.25 fsへ、CO₂では2 fsから1 fsへ変えると、圧力のずれは数%まで増えました。\\ "
"今回の混合精度の圧力は、時間刻みについて収束した数値ではありません。\\ "
"図の倍精度系列は、別の数値精度で得た参考結果を並べたもので、混合精度の刻み依存性を補正した値ではありません。"
msgstr ""
"Reducing the time step from 0.5 fs to 0.25 fs for H₂ and from 2 fs to 1 "
"fs for CO₂ increased the pressure deviations to several percent. \\ The "
"mixed-precision pressures here have not converged with respect to the "
"time step. \\ The double-precision series in the figure provides a "
"reference at a different numerical precision. It does not correct for the"
" time-step dependence of the mixed-precision results."

#: ../../gas_laws/reproduction.rst:375
msgid ""
"測定区間の前半・後半の温度と圧力、結合長、CO₂の角度、全系の重心速度は\\ ``stability.csv`` に保存しています。\\ "
"採用した5気体の各シードについて、前半と後半の平均圧力の差の絶対値は最大約0.0028 barでした。\\ ブロック長ごとの誤差は "
"``block_scan.csv`` で確認できます。\\ "
"温度制御中は熱浴とエネルギーを交換するため、全エネルギーの保存を合否基準にはしていません。\\ 温度・エネルギーの時系列は "
"``energy_raw.csv`` に分けて保存しています。"
msgstr ""
"Temperatures and pressures in the first and second halves of the "
"production period, bond lengths, the CO₂ angle, and the system center-of-"
"mass velocity are recorded in \\ ``stability.csv``. \\ Across the seeds "
"used for each of the five gases, the largest absolute difference in mean "
"pressure between the two halves was about 0.0028 bar. \\ Errors by block "
"length are available in ``block_scan.csv``. \\ The system exchanges "
"energy with a heat bath during temperature control, so total energy "
"conservation is not a pass criterion. \\ The temperature and energy time "
"series are saved separately in ``energy_raw.csv``."

#: ../../gas_laws/reproduction.rst:383
msgid "Arのずれの独立予測"
msgstr "Independent Prediction of the Deviation for Ar"

#: ../../gas_laws/reproduction.rst:385
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"ArのLJポテンシャルを :math:`u(r)=4\\epsilon[(\\sigma/r)^{12}-(\\sigma/r)^6]` "
"とし、\\ カットオフ :math:`r_c=1.2` nmでポテンシャルをシフトした二体分布を使います。\\ "
"圧力に寄与する第二ビリアルの係数を次の数値積分で求めます。"
msgstr ""
"We use :math:`u(r)=4\\epsilon[(\\sigma/r)^{12}-(\\sigma/r)^6]` for the Ar"
" LJ potential \\ and use the pair distribution for this potential shifted"
" at the cutoff :math:`r_c=1.2` nm. \\ We obtain the second virial "
"coefficient for the pressure contribution by evaluating the following "
"integral numerically."

#: ../../gas_laws/reproduction.rst:389
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"B_{2,P}&=-\\frac{2\\pi N_A}{3RT}\n"
"  \\int_0^{r_c}r^3 u'(r)g(r)\\,dr,\\\\\n"
"g(r)&=\\exp\\!\\left[-\\frac{u(r)-u(r_c)}{RT}\\right].\n"
"\\end{aligned}"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"B_{2,P}&=-\\frac{2\\pi N_A}{3RT}\n"
"  \\int_0^{r_c}r^3 u'(r)g(r)\\,dr,\\\\\n"
"g(r)&=\\exp\\!\\left[-\\frac{u(r)-u(r_c)}{RT}\\right].\n"
"\\end{aligned}"

#: ../../gas_laws/reproduction.rst:397
msgid ""
"式のエネルギーと気体定数は同じ単位系にそろえます。\\ ``theory.py`` "
"はモデルのσ、ε、カットオフだけを入力とし、MD圧力を読みません。\\ 圧力用の係数は約−15.772 "
"cm³/molで、積分点数を50,000から100,000へ増やした差は約10⁻⁹ cm³/molでした。\\ "
"ポテンシャルをカットオフで0へシフトし、力をそこで打ち切ったモデルの係数です。\\ 打ち切りのないLJの第二ビリアルとは区別しています。"
msgstr ""
"We express the energy and gas constant in consistent units. \\ "
"``theory.py`` takes only σ, ε, and the cutoff of the model as inputs and "
"does not read MD pressures. \\ The resulting coefficient for the pressure"
" is about −15.772 cm³/mol, and increasing the number of integration "
"points from 50,000 to 100,000 changed it by about 10⁻⁹ cm³/mol. \\ It "
"applies to the model in which the potential is shifted to zero at the "
"cutoff and the force is truncated there. \\ It is distinct from the "
"second virial coefficient of the untruncated LJ potential."

#: ../../gas_laws/reproduction.rst:403
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"希薄な二体近似と全体の重心運動の除去を組み合わせた予測は、\\ 各体積の実測平均温度を :math:`\\overline{T}` "
"として、次の式です。"
msgstr ""
"The prediction combines the dilute-gas pair approximation and removal of "
"the motion of the system’s center of mass. \\ With the measured mean "
"temperature at each volume denoted by :math:`\\overline{T}`, the "
"prediction is"

#: ../../gas_laws/reproduction.rst:406
msgid ""
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"P_{\\mathrm{pred}}&=\\frac{RT}{V_m}\n"
"   \\frac{N-1}{N}\\left(1+\\frac{B_{2,P}}{V_m}\\right)\n"
"   \\frac{\\overline{T}}{T},\\\\\n"
"T&=273.15\\ \\mathrm{K},\\quad N=1000.\n"
"\\end{aligned}"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"P_{\\mathrm{pred}}&=\\frac{RT}{V_m}\n"
"   \\frac{N-1}{N}\\left(1+\\frac{B_{2,P}}{V_m}\\right)\n"
"   \\frac{\\overline{T}}{T},\\\\\n"
"T&=273.15\\ \\mathrm{K},\\quad N=1000.\n"
"\\end{aligned}"

#: ../../gas_laws/reproduction.rst:415
msgid ""
"温度の小さな違いにはこの式の一次補正を使い、係数の温度微分や三体以上の項は含めていません。\\ ``argon_virial.json`` "
"に係数と積分条件、``argon_deviations.csv`` に6体積の予測・測定・残差を保存しています。\\ "
"圧力を自由フィットした係数とは独立した比較です。"
msgstr ""
"The equation applies a first-order correction for small temperature "
"differences and excludes the temperature derivative of the coefficient "
"and terms involving three or more particles. \\ ``argon_virial.json`` "
"contains the coefficient and integration settings, and "
"``argon_deviations.csv`` records the predictions, measurements, and "
"residuals for the six volumes. \\ This comparison is independent of the "
"coefficients fitted freely to the pressures."

#: ../../gas_laws/reproduction.rst:420
msgid "時間相関と追加の対照"
msgstr "Time Correlations and Additional Controls"

#: ../../gas_laws/reproduction.rst:422
msgid ""
"``autocorrelation.csv`` に圧力の積分自己相関時間を併記しています。\\ 標本間隔は0.1 "
"psで、自己相関の隣接2項の和が初めて非正となる前までを積分しました。\\ 独立な標本なら積分時間は標本間隔の半分になる定義です。\\ "
"今回の採用計算の推定値は約0.062〜0.133 psで、5 ps以上のブロックより短い値でした。\\ "
"短い記録からの推定であり、平衡化や全ての遅い変動の不存在を証明する指標ではありません。\\ 80 "
"psブロックは5個しかないため、その誤差推定が粗い点にも注意してください。"
msgstr ""
"``autocorrelation.csv`` also includes the integrated autocorrelation time"
" of pressure. \\ The sampling interval is 0.1 ps, and we integrated up to"
" the first pair of adjacent autocorrelation terms with a nonpositive sum,"
" excluding that pair. \\ With this definition, the integrated time for "
"independent samples is half the sampling interval. \\ The estimates for "
"the runs used here were about 0.062–0.133 ps, shorter than the block "
"lengths of 5 ps and above. \\ These estimates come from short records and"
" do not establish equilibration or show that all slow fluctuations are "
"absent. \\ Note that the error estimate from 80 ps blocks is rough "
"because there are only five such blocks."

#: ../../gas_laws/reproduction.rst:429
msgid ""
"二原子分子の速さがそろって理論値より約0.07%低い理由の切り分けは未完了です。\\ "
"速度の保存時刻と拘束・有限時間刻みの影響も含めた対照が必要で、熱浴の種類だけを原因と決めていません。"
msgstr ""
"We have yet to isolate why the speeds of the diatomic molecules are "
"consistently about 0.07% below the theoretical values. \\ Controls are "
"still needed to examine the timing of saved velocities and the effects of"
" constraints and a finite time step. We have not attributed the "
"discrepancy to the type of heat bath alone."

#: ../../gas_laws/reproduction.rst:432
msgid ""
"Arのシード1101では、リスト更新を10ステップ、リスト半径1.3 nm、\\ ``verlet-buffer-tolerance = -1``"
" に固定した440 psの対照も行いました。\\ ログでも0.1 nmのバッファを確認し、40〜440 psの平均圧力は1.01145 ± "
"0.00062 barでした。\\ 元の自動調整（100ステップ、バッファ0）での1.01192 ± 0.00066 "
"barとの差は、統計誤差より小さい値です。\\ 1条件の確認であり、他の気体や密度すべてのリスト収束を保証するものではありません。"
msgstr ""
"For Ar with seed 1101, we also ran a 440 ps control with the neighbor "
"list updated every 10 steps, a list radius of 1.3 nm, and \\ ``verlet-"
"buffer-tolerance = -1``. \\ We confirmed the 0.1 nm buffer in the log. "
"The mean pressure from 40 to 440 ps was 1.01145 ± 0.00062 bar. \\ The "
"difference from 1.01192 ± 0.00066 bar with the original automatic "
"settings (100 steps, buffer of 0) was smaller than the statistical error."
" \\ This check covers one condition and does not guarantee neighbor-list "
"convergence for all other gases or densities."

#: ../../gas_laws/reproduction.rst:438
msgid ""
"N₂の倍精度SDでは、熱浴の緩和時間を0.1 psから10 psへ弱めた対照を追加しました。\\ 全640 psのうち最初の240 "
"psを除いた400 psで、圧力は1.01492 ± 0.00444 bar、\\ 重心rms速さは493.72 ± 1.11 m/sでした。\\"
" 同シードの0.1 ps条件は1.01162 ± 0.00070 bar、493.14 ± 0.32 "
"m/sで、差は合成した統計標準誤差以内でした。\\ 弱い熱浴では相関時間も長く、より長い測定が必要です。\\ "
"CO₂での同じ弱熱浴対照は未実施で、すべてのモデルが熱浴の強さに依存しないことを示したわけではありません。\\ これらの条件と数値は "
"``review_controls.csv`` にも記録しています。"
msgstr ""
"In double-precision SD for N₂, we added a control with a weaker heat bath"
" by increasing the relaxation time from 0.1 ps to 10 ps. \\ Over the 400 "
"ps after the first 240 ps of the 640 ps run, the pressure was 1.01492 ± "
"0.00444 bar \\ and the center-of-mass RMS speed was 493.72 ± 1.11 m/s. \\"
" With the same seed at 0.1 ps, the results were 1.01162 ± 0.00070 bar and"
" 493.14 ± 0.32 m/s, with differences within the combined statistical "
"standard errors. \\ The weaker heat bath also gives longer correlation "
"times, so a longer measurement is needed. \\ We have yet to run the same "
"weak-heat-bath control for CO₂, and the comparison does not show that all"
" models are independent of heat-bath strength. \\ The conditions and "
"values are also recorded in ``review_controls.csv``."

